  <ThingDef ParentName="Crimson_ExtraDecorBase">
    <defName>Crimson_CommandSeat</defName>
    <passability>Standable</passability>
    <label>심홍 지휘석</label>
    <description>검은 각면 등받이와 짙은 쿠션을 갖춘 지휘석입니다. 앉아서 식사나 휴식을 할 수 있으며 전원 공급 시 편안함이 50% 향상됩니다. 통전 시 250W로 팔걸이의 진홍색 표시등과 편안함 보조 장치를 작동합니다. 함선 조종 기능은 없습니다.</description>
    <size>(1,1)</size>
    <rotatable>true</rotatable>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <uiIconPath>Crimson/Decor/Extras/CommandSeat</uiIconPath>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Crimson/Decor/Extras/CommandSeatDirections</texPath>
      <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
      <graphicClass>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonDirectionalSeatGraphic</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(1,1.4)</drawSize>
      <drawRotated>false</drawRotated>
      <drawOffset>(0,0,0.2)</drawOffset>
      <addTopAltitudeBias>true</addTopAltitudeBias>
    </graphicData>
    <defaultPlacingRot>South</defaultPlacingRot>
    <socialPropernessMatters>true</socialPropernessMatters>
    <pathCost>30</pathCost>
    <fillPercent>0.35</fillPercent>
    <building><isSittable>true</isSittable><isInert>false</isInert></building>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>1400</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>400</WorkToBuild><Comfort>1</Comfort><Beauty>80</Beauty><MarketValue>3001.296</MarketValue><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
